        "TileImage": "$($repository a5be536f-8cc1-444a-abe1-a3f0d7cf8ecd).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47.\r\rYour targets are Joseph Rickman and Jae Serio. Two prominent Providence operatives and undercover Hitmen. \r\rThese two men, though they may seem unimportant, have been heavily tracked by Villani&apos;s mercenary group, which went as far as recording their phone conversations.\r\rThough we don&apos;t know much about the men, it is safe to assume that they have to know at least something about the leadership of Queen Anne II, and all information is valuable.\r\rI will leave you to prepare.",
